        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "https://educationdata.urban.org/documentation/index.html",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
  {
    "type": "updateEntity",
    "id": {
      "$bytes": "5a7f371a4c234c2f9834d93da8a01f6b"
    },
    "set": [
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Urban Education Data Portal catalog metadata",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "e3e363d1dd294ccb8e6ff3b76d99bc33"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Catalog metadata\n\n- **Steward:** Urban Institute.\n- **Access:** Public JSON API.\n- **Unit:** Source-dependent public administrative data.\n- **Coverage:** Endpoint-dependent and source-dependent.\n- **Geography:** School, district, college, and state.\n- **Join keys:** NCES school ID, LEA ID, UNITID, FIPS, and year.\n- **Uses:** Programmatic extraction, rapid field-shape validation, and prototype queries.\n- **Provenance:** Use the originating agency as the authority for published claims.\n\nThe portal can deliver CCD, CRDC, EDFacts, IPEDS, and related public data. Delivery access does not turn a portal extract into causal evidence.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
